@startuml fig_cache_read_copy
!include _style.puml
' Book figure — the cache is a non-authoritative read copy beside the authoritative database.
' Form: structure. Evidence status: conceptual illustration; asserts no rate.
title source correctness belongs to the mutation; copy correctness belongs to the publication
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 26

rectangle "client" as CL
rectangle "application\n(readers + writer W)" as APP
rectangle "source database\n(authoritative)" as DB <<authoritative>>
rectangle "cache\n(non-authoritative read copy)" as K <<external>>

CL --> APP : request
APP --> DB : mutation · authoritative read
APP --> K : publication / fill
DB --> K : propagation / invalidation

note right of DB
  source correctness: a lock + invariant
  recheck or a conditional update decides
  who wins the mutation.
end note
note right of K
  copy correctness: propagation, publication
  or hit validation orders what leaves the
  transaction. The freshness contract says
  what a hit is allowed to mean.
end note
@enduml
